<!--
  The status-bar icon for the "sharing your location" notification.

  A flat white silhouette on transparency, because that is all Android draws:
  the system tints the whole shape and discards colour, so anything else would
  arrive as a white blob. A location pin rather than the app mark — in the
  status bar the question a rider is answering is "what is running", not
  "which app".
-->
